["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ecli", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[European Case Law Identifier (ECLI)](https://data.europa.eu/data/datasets/european-case-law-identifier-ecli) is a uniform identifier for judicial decisions across Europe. It consists of five mandatory components: the \"ECLI\" prefix, a country code, a court code, the year of the decision, and a unique serial number (e.g., `ECLI:EU:C:2023:94`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Nab3175137acd435b9f6a1c30a4008778", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SoftwarePurpose/device", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/ibid", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "[International Business Identifier (IBID)](https://ekys.org/business_identifiers/) is a verifiable unique identifier for legal entities as defined in the [ISO/DIS 25500-3](https://www.iso.org/standard/87705.html) draft standard. It is composed of three data elements: the International Business Registration Number (IBRN), the legal name, and the date of origin formatted as eight numeric characters (YYYYMMDD). Each element is separated by a pipe character (`|`) (e.g., `US-DE.BER:3031657|Code Management Association|19990420`).", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/modifiedBy", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The `from` Element is modified by each `to` Element.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/knownBias", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range", "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/unitQUDT", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "QUDT unit is used for measurement criteria based on product type, region and use.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/datasetNoise", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty", "globalId", "", ""]
